      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Introducing 16 St Patricks Terrace, a well presented three bedroom, one bathroom terraced house, in turnkey condition and ideally located within walking distance of Cavan town. This property represents a fantastic opportunity for any discerning buyer to acquire an investment property in a prime location or get on the property ladder. \r\n\r\nComprising of a welcoming entrance hallway and a large open plan kitchen / living room. The fully equipped kitchen has access to a private rear garden. the ground floor is complete with a single bedroom to the front. Upstairs are two double bedrooms. The property is boasts a fully-equipped bathroom. \r\n\r\nThe property comes to the market with oil fired central heating throughout and a low maintenance garden. There is also on street parking to the front. \r\n\r\nMore about the location…\r\n\r\nSituated within walking distance of Cavan town, number 16 St Patricks Terrace is within walking distance to all the local amenities. There are local schools and transport links via Cavan Bus Station also within walking distance. There is a host of sports facilities to include gym, GAA grounds and soccer facilities nearby. The nightlife offers an abundance of pubs and restaurants a short walk away."
